      "writtenOn": "2024-05-10T13:14:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "mBlockedStatusTrackingUids tracks the uid and number of registered network requests.\nIf we increment or decrement count twice for the same network request info, counter in mBlockedStatusTrackingUids will be wrong.\nSo to decrease the possibility of miscounting, I added this flag and check this flag before increment or decrement the count.",
